---
/**
 * Compact ecosystem-context strip. The canonical responsibility topology
 * lives on the Agentic Workstation route; this strip states the toolkit's
 * two verified edges and links there instead of repeating the diagram.
 */
---

<aside class="atk-context" aria-labelledby="atk-context-title">
  <h2 id="atk-context-title" class="atk-context__title">Ecosystem context</h2>
  <p class="atk-context__body">
    Agent Toolkit is one of four Personal DX projects. <a href="/agentic-workstation">Agentic Workstation</a> can provision
    its host dependencies, and the toolkit provides capabilities and workspace commands to <a href="/agentic-harness"
      >Agentic Harness</a
    >, which holds the persistent workspace state.
  </p>
  <p class="atk-context__link">
    <a href="/agentic-workstation#dx-topology-title">View the full responsibility topology →</a>
  </p>
</aside>

<style>
  .atk-context {
    max-width: min(100% - 3rem, 74rem);
    margin: 2rem auto;
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    border-inline-start: 2px solid var(--theme-accent-secondary, #38bdf8);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-accent, #6b4a9c) 8%, transparent);
  }

  .atk-context__title {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-text-faint);
  }

  .atk-context__body {
    margin: 0.5rem 0 0;
    max-inline-size: 62ch;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .atk-context__link {
    margin: 0.5rem 0 0;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
</style>
